**总字数：5500-6500字 | 页数：20-25页**

**重要：每个章节都必须详细展开！不要简略！这是客户花$29.99买的专业报告！**` :
`You are a McKinsey-level commercial real estate consultant. Client paid $29.99 and expects exceptional value.

Location: ${location.address}
Business: ${understanding.business || 'commercial'}
Date: ${currentDate} (March 6, 2026)
${nearbyContext}

Generate a 20-25 page professional report (5500-6500 words).

Include: Executive Summary (with scoring), Regional Economics (2026 Q1 data), Demographics & Consumer Power, Traffic Analysis, Competition Analysis (detailed SWOT for each competitor using real Google Maps data above), Cost Analysis (2026 prices), Financial Projections (2026-2028 monthly breakdown), Top 5 Business Types, Risk Assessment, Action Plan.

Each section must be fully developed with specific numbers and deep analysis. This is a premium paid report!`;

    console.log('🤖 Generating premium report...');
    
    const message = await anthropic.messages.create({
      model: 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514',
      max_tokens: 16000,
      temperature: 0.7,
      messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }],
    });

    const report = message.content[0].text || 'Generation error';
    console.log(`✅ Generated: ${report.length} chars`);
    
    const reportId = `PQ-${type.toUpperCase()}-${Date.now()}`;
    const reportData = {
      reportId,
      address: location.address,
      location: { lat: location.lat, lng: location.lng },
      language,
      date: currentDate,
      type
    };

    // ✅ 异步发送邮件（不阻塞响应）
    if (email && email.includes('@') && email.length > 5) {
      console.log('📧 Sending email asynchronously...');
      sendReportEmail(email, reportData, report).catch(err => {
        console.error('❌ Email error:', err);
      });
    }

    // ✅ 立刻返回报告给前端
    res.json({
      success: true,
      report,
      location: { lat: location.lat, lng: location.lng },
      address: location.address,
      language,
      date: currentDate,
      reportId,
      emailSent: email && email.includes('@') ? 'sending' : 'no_email'
    });
    
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('❌ Error:', error);
    res.status(500).json({ error: error.message });
  }
});

